        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space Adventures 2 in 1 is a collection of arcade-style space shooter games taking inspiration from the classics<i> Asteroids</i> (Space Explorers) and<i> Space Invaders</i> (Space Defenders).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space Explorer</strong>s: Pilot your ship through open space, dodging and shooting the incoming asteroids to avoid collisions. Scored based on the amount of time you manage to survive, move freely through the entire screen to maximize your chances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space Defenders:</strong> Defend your position against the waves of enemy ships that descend and shoot on your ship. Moving only left and right, shoot the invaders as you avoid their lasers, and prevent them from reaching the bottom of the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both game modes focus on quick movement and reflexes, maintaining a retro-like feeling, featuring cartoonish sprites and sounds, and are designed for short, replayable sessions. More content will be incoming to make both game modes more complex and challenging as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
